---
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Acquianted Colorado" description="About Acquianted Colorado">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Thanks for stopping by. Read below to learn more about Acquainted Colorado."
			>
				<img
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/women-together.jpg"
					alt="Three women with their arms around each other, backs to the camera."
				/>
			</Hero>

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						This site was created to keep track of upcoming opportunities to connect with other people and to keep track of useful information. The site is organized into two different areas. First you have the "blog". It's a monthly list of events held by third-party organizations or individuals with absolutely no ties to Acuainted Colorado. We are not endorsing these organizations or their events. We're just sharing information.
					</p>
					<p>
						The second area is the Resources section of the site. Here I'm keeping a running list of helpful resources to either help you stay afloat in tough times or pursue your passion. Just like for the Blog, we are not endorsing these organizations, websites or resources. We're just sharing information.
					</p>
					<p>
						This site was created by a black queer HUMAN woman with invisible disabilities. She's only human. She might make a mistake here and there. You may also find something she wrote or said offensive. Please give her the benefit of the doubt that she has no intention of harming anyone in any way shape or form and is doing her best, probably just like you.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Mission</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Our mission is to help people live their best lives by linking them to opportunities to connect with other people and opportunities to pursue their passions.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Values</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Our values include:
						<ul>
							<li>Diversity</li>
							<li>Equity</li>
							<li>Inclusion</li>
							<li>Education</li>
							<li>Freedom</li>
							<li>Self-Determination</li>
							<li>Love</li>
						</ul>
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">We're Against</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>We are against:
						<ul>
							<li>Using AI for non-complicated tasks in your daily life. This includes but is not limited to:
								<ul>
								<li>Planning trips</li>
								<li>Advice</li>
								<li>Questions a basic search engine could answer</li>
								<li>Reading your email for you</li>
							</ul></li>
							<li>Building Data Centers in drought stricken communities and near people's homes and places of work.</li>
							<li>Off leash dogs in areas public areas where that is not prohibited such as most trails, parks and neighborhoods.</li>
							<li>Racism</li>
							<li>Sexism</li>
							<li>Homophobia (or any exclusion or violence against LGBTQIA+ individuals)</li>
							<li>Probably other things not listed here.</li>
						</ul>
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
